<title>USA: Amerac to explore strategic alternatives.</title>
<headline>Amerac to explore strategic alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerac Energy Corp on Wednesday said its board of directors formed a committee to explore a number of strategic alternatives, including a possible merger or business combination.</p>
<p>The company said that there was no assurance that any specific transaction would occur as a result of this initiative.</p>
<p>Amerac is involved in the acquisition, production and further development of oil and gas properties primarily in Texas and Oklahoma.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
